The Lost Tribes Scenario
Difficulty : 5
Bonus : 50
--------------------------------------------------------------
Although you have a strong Fort and several good leaders, you have few people to rule over.
But there is an ancient legend of a lost tribe that left your land in times of trouble many centuries ago.  You must go forth and find these people, if they still exist, and bring their Towns back into the Empire.
You must also build an Economic Score of 300 and a Military Score of 200.  You will have 20 years in which to complete all of these goals.

